## HTTP Client di Go

Go memiliki HTTP client yang powerful di package `net/http`. Kita bisa membuat request GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, dll.

## GET Request Sederhana

```go
package main

import (
	"fmt"
	"io"
	"net/http"
)

func main() {
	resp, err := http.Get("https://api.github.com/users/golang")
	if err != nil {
		fmt.Println("Error:", err)
		return
	}
	defer resp.Body.Close() // SELALU close body!

	fmt.Println("Status:", resp.Status)
	fmt.Println("Content-Type:", resp.Header.Get("Content-Type"))

	body, _ := io.ReadAll(resp.Body)
	fmt.Println(string(body))
}
```

## POST Request dengan JSON Body

```go
package main

import (
	"bytes"
	"encoding/json"
	"fmt"
	"net/http"
)

type CreatePost struct {
	Title  string `json:"title"`
	Body   string `json:"body"`
	UserID int    `json:"userId"`
}

func main() {
	payload := CreatePost{Title: "Go HTTP", Body: "Learning Go", UserID: 1}

	data, _ := json.Marshal(payload)
	resp, err := http.Post(
		"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts",
		"application/json",
		bytes.NewBuffer(data),
	)
	if err != nil {
		fmt.Println("Error:", err)
		return
	}
	defer resp.Body.Close()

	fmt.Println("Status:", resp.StatusCode)
}
```

## Custom Client dengan Timeout

Selalu gunakan custom client dengan timeout — **jangan pernah gunakan** `http.DefaultClient` untuk production karena tidak ada timeout:

```go
client := &http.Client{
	Timeout: 10 * time.Second,
}

// Request dengan custom headers
req, err := http.NewRequest(http.MethodGet, "https://api.example.com/data", nil)
if err != nil {
	log.Fatal(err)
}
req.Header.Set("Authorization", "Bearer "+token)
req.Header.Set("Accept", "application/json")

resp, err := client.Do(req)
if err != nil {
	log.Fatal(err)
}
defer resp.Body.Close()
```

## Decode JSON Response

```go
type GitHubUser struct {
	Login string `json:"login"`
	Name  string `json:"name"`
	Bio   string `json:"bio"`
}

func getGitHubUser(username string) (*GitHubUser, error) {
	client := &http.Client{Timeout: 10 * time.Second}

	resp, err := client.Get("https://api.github.com/users/" + username)
	if err != nil {
		return nil, fmt.Errorf("request: %w", err)
	}
	defer resp.Body.Close()

	if resp.StatusCode != http.StatusOK {
		return nil, fmt.Errorf("unexpected status: %d", resp.StatusCode)
	}

	var user GitHubUser
	if err := json.NewDecoder(resp.Body).Decode(&user); err != nil {
		return nil, fmt.Errorf("decode: %w", err)
	}
	return &user, nil
}
```

